@startuml
title PayLink - Payment State Diagram

top to bottom direction
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ranksep 90
skinparam nodesep 100
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #EAF3FF
    BorderColor #3973AC
    FontColor #183153
}

[*] --> Initiated

Initiated -left-> Rejected : Fraud check fails\nor funds insufficient
Initiated -right-> FundsHeld : Fraud checks pass\nand funds sufficient

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : Request sent to biller

SentToBiller -left-> Completed : Biller confirms
SentToBiller -right-> Failed : Biller refuses
SentToBiller --> Unknown : No answer within timeout

Unknown -left-> Completed : Biller later confirms\n(callback / retry / settlement file)
Unknown -right-> Failed : Biller later refuses /\nreconciliation finds no payment

Failed --> Refunded : Hold released to wallet

Rejected --> [*]
Completed --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Unknown
  Money remains held.
  No automatic refund.
  Wait for confirmation
  or reconciliation.
end note

note right of Completed
  Final state.
  No further transitions.
end note

note right of Refunded
  Final state.
end note
@enduml